OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWindy along the coast with the
OL,6,Fchance of an odd shower in the west,
OL,7,Fbright spells. Any early showers will
OL,8,Fdie as bright or sunny spells increase
OL,9,Fthrough the morning. The wind will
OL,10,Fease down by the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe evening will be dry with
OL,13,Fclear spells but cloud will soon
OL,14,Fincrease with rain, some heavy,
OL,15,Ffollowing from the west from midnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FCloudy with rain and drizzle
OL,18,Fin the early morning. The rain will
OL,19,Fsoon clear with bright spells
OL,20,Fincreasing from the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
